---
import ProjectLayout from "../layouts/project-layout.astro";
import Image from "../components/image.astro";
import snppyImg from "../assets/projects/pages/snappy-trnsprnt.png"
---

<ProjectLayout name="snappy" colour="#6bc4ff">
    <div class="paragraph">
        <p>
            Snappy Nano was UVic’s Autonomous Underwater Vehicles Interdisciplinary Club RoboSub2026 submarine that competed in the annual competition down in California. 
            I had the pleasure to work alongside their software team to develop early firmware code, movement, and simulator tests.

        </p>
    </div>
    <Image src={snppyImg.src} colour="#6bc4ff" class="snppyImg"></Image>

    <div class="paragraph">
        <p>This project has developed my skills in several real world software techniques including version management, communication, prototyping, and 
            tackling learning curves. Through my time being a part of the team, I grew competent in C, C++, ROS2, Git, Gazebo, SDF, Linux systems, and had hands 
            on experience with STM, PID control, hydrodynamics, machine learning, 
        </p>
    </div>
</ProjectLayout>

<style>
    .snppyImg{
        position: relative;
        width: 20%;
        justify-self: flex-end;
        margin: -5% -5% 0 0;
    }
</style>